# The refusal cases of the CloudFormation corpus. Each file under invalid/
# is the template SNS/SNSTopic.yaml (or SNS/SNSTopic.json) of
# aws-cloudformation-templates changed to break one rule of the template
# format; an upstream/ file listed here is an unchanged upstream template
# the reader refuses.
# Columns: file, path of the refusal, refusal class, the rule broken.
invalid/version.yaml	AWSTemplateFormatVersion	FormatVersion	the template format version is 2010-09-09
invalid/transform.yaml	Transform	Unsupported	transforms are out of scope
invalid/unresolved-ref.yaml	Resources.SNSSubscription.Properties.TopicArn.Ref	Unresolved	a Ref names a parameter, a resource or a pseudo parameter
invalid/unresolved-getatt.yaml	Outputs.QueueName.Value.Fn::GetAtt	Unresolved	Fn::GetAtt names a resource
invalid/unknown-section.yaml	Resource	UnknownField	a template has only its ten sections
invalid/logical-id.yaml	Resources.SNS-Topic	Invalid	a logical ID is alphanumeric
invalid/parameter-type.yaml	Parameters.SubscriptionEndPoint.Type	Invalid	a parameter type is one the format defines
invalid/resource-type.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.Type	Invalid	a resource type is Custom::name or three segments
invalid/unknown-attribute.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.Deletion	UnknownField	a resource has only its nine attributes
invalid/depends-on.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.DependsOn	Unresolved	DependsOn names resources
invalid/condition.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.Condition	Unresolved	a resource's Condition names a condition
invalid/deletion-policy.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.DeletionPolicy	Invalid	the deletion policies are Delete, Retain, RetainExceptOnCreate and Snapshot
invalid/unknown-tag.yaml	Resources.SNSSubscription.Properties.Endpoint	UnknownTag	a local tag is a short form
invalid/tagged-sequence.yaml		TaggedCollection	the shared YAML route carries no tag on a sequence
invalid/macro.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic.Properties.Fn::Transform	Unsupported	macros are out of scope
invalid/output-no-value.yaml	Outputs.TopicARN	Missing	an output has a Value
invalid/duplicate-name.yaml	Resources.SNSTopic	DuplicateName	a parameter and a resource do not share a logical ID
invalid/rules.yaml	Rules	Unsupported	the Rules section is out of scope
invalid/two-documents.yaml		Syntax	one document is one template
invalid/duplicate-key.json		Syntax	a JSON object's keys are distinct
upstream/CloudFormation_fn-foreach-ddb.json	Transform	Unsupported	the AWS::LanguageExtensions transform is out of scope
